# Repository-root ignore rules.
#
# Vercel reads .vercelignore from the deploy root. This project's Root
# Directory is unset, so it deploys the whole repository and landing/.vercelignore
# is never consulted — these rules are the ones that actually apply.
#
# landing/assets/ holds the full set of raw admin captures (~27 MB) kept as
# source material. They show real candidate names and email addresses, and a
# static host serves anything inside the deployed directory, so without these
# rules every one of those screenshots is reachable by anyone who guesses the
# path. Only the cropped, blurred derivatives in landing/assets/shots/ belong
# on a public URL.

landing/assets/*
!landing/assets/shots/
!landing/assets/fonts/
!landing/assets/brand/

# Source material, docs and build tooling — no reason to ship them.
landing/reference/
landing/DESIGN.md
landing/PROVENANCE.md
landing/build-standalone.py
landing/standalone.html
